docs/vendor/**/*.pdf

# Claude Code session state and, crucially, the per-lane git worktrees that live at
# .claude/worktrees/ - a `git add -A` in the main checkout would otherwise sweep every
# other lane's working tree into a commit. Nothing under .claude/ is tracked today
# (verified 2026-09-21: `git ls-files .claude` is empty).
.claude/
